+"""Source-scoped RN reference/definition roles. Proposed helper; no core mutation.
+
+Code-only cards and citations in EXPLICAÇÃO/EXEMPLOS/SUGESTÕES are retained as
+literal references, with their entire physical cell in source_context. They do
+not acquire the neighboring Ementa/teacher prose as a new coded learning item.
